 "$comment": [
   "Every face JIZURA (852wa/JIZURA bae339e, src/02_fonts.js and src/02b_lang.js) can ask for, pinned: upstream file at an exact commit, its SHA-256, and its licence.",
   "Built by scripts/fonts/jizura-packs.ts (see docs/development.md, 'JIZURA font packs'). `bun scripts/fonts/jizura-packs.ts --pin` fills in an empty sha256 from a fresh download.",
   "Noto CJK comes from notofonts/noto-cjk 'SubsetOTF' (CFF, overlap-free): the TrueType and variable builds keep overlapping contours, which JIZURA's outline treatments (strokeText) draw as inner lines.",
   "Static Noto CJK has no weight 800: JIZURA's Serif 800 (tokumin, shippori outside Japanese) snaps to 900.",
   "IBM Plex (Mono, Sans JP, Sans KR) reserves the font name \"Plex\": those files are only converted to WOFF2, never cut, so IBM Plex Sans JP is bundled whole."
 ],
